# Form UX & Validation Spec

## Validation behavior

- Always keep the `Submit` button enabled, except while submitting (`loading` state).
- When user clicks `Submit`, validate the entire form (all items/fields), not only the ones that were modified.
- Validate on change and show the error message directly under the field.
- When the user enters a value that satisfies validation, the field error message must disappear (no error shown anymore).

## Placeholder color

- Placeholder text color must be light gray and consistent across all screens.

## Hover behavior

- On hover: dropdowns, buttons, and checkboxes should show the hand cursor (`cursor: pointer`).
- When the `Submit` button is in `loading` state, the button must be disabled and show `cursor: not-allowed`.
